The catch? Graph RAG’s global context prompts the LLM to over-engineer, dropping cyclomatic consistency by 25 pts and docstring carry-over by 6. Still, for codebases where broken dependencies are a dealbreaker, this graph-first method is a leap forward—less hallucination, more real-world viability.

